  "body": "1/32 Glenenandrew Drive\r\n\r\nStriking contemporary design with exceptional street appeal, this stylish home offers approximately 170m² of spacious, light-filled living.\r\n\r\n\r\n• 4 bedrooms, including a master suite\r\n• 2.5 bathrooms\r\n• Upstairs open-plan retreat, ideal as a second lounge or family relaxation area\r\n• Modern open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a deck and generous outdoor space\r\n• Artificial turf laid over a well-compacted base, creating a practical and versatile area for everyday use\r\n\r\nParkside Living at Its Best\r\n\r\nWith a park at arm's length, enjoy the simple pleasures of an evening stroll, fresh air and peaceful green surroundings after a busy day.\r\n\r\nConveniently located near sought-after Eastern Suburbs schooling options, including Macleans College and Bucklands Beach Intermediate, subject to school zone confirmation.\r\n\r\nAsking Price: $1,349,000\r\n\r\nContemporary style, generous space and a park-side lifestyle at an attractive price.\r\n\r\nContact me today to arrange your viewing!",
